[input-model] Abstract input packet seam (complete)
Files: crates/caravan-demo/src/lib.rs; crates/caravan-demo/src/input.rs
Do: Define the smallest Caravan-facing InputPacket and InputPacketSet values plus the application InteractionDefinition seam. Keep host/device events out of the model, keep buffered and unbuffered construction invisible to the query, and make the query receive Tau and LogicalTime explicitly. Use closed static types; do not add host timestamps or a dynamic packet bag.
Accept: Unit-level behavior proves equal packet sets with equal Tau and LogicalTime produce equal transformation results; the seam cannot access JournalWriter, Worldline mutation, prior GameState, host time, or an input-mode flag.
