[transformation-model] Closed Caravan transformations (complete)
Files: crates/caravan-demo/src/transformation.rs
Do: Define the smallest closed Caravan Transformation DU needed by one player event. Keep journal-authoring payloads distinct from Stage-local or branch operations, and provide the narrow conversion needed when an accepted transformation becomes a GameJournalEntry. Do not expose timestamped entry construction to InteractionDefinition.
Accept: The transformation type is statically exhaustive, contains no trait objects or Any, and one accepted variant can be converted into an existing Caravan journal payload without choosing its timestamp.
