[orchestrator-core] Developer-authored Orchestrator control (complete)
Files: crates/caravan-demo/src/orchestrator.rs
Do: Implement the ordinary mutable CaravanOrchestrator control object that owns the selected ReferenceWorldline, JournalWriter/publication path, Playback, Tau selection, packet accumulation, InteractionDefinition, branch/lookahead choices, and save/presentation decisions. Permit a literal loop or explicit step method as an application choice. Keep all authoritative game data in immutable published values.
Accept: The Orchestrator can choose a Tau, derive LogicalTime through Playback, query arbitrary past/present/future samples, run the interaction seam, accept or reject transformations, replace its selected immutable worldline, and expose no mutable board/actor/resource/effect/GameState store.
