[stage-composition] Caravan Stage composition (complete)
Files: crates/caravan-demo/src/stage.rs
Do: Compose the Orchestrator with the existing generic presentation renderer and query path behind a concrete CaravanStage boundary. Keep the host-facing surface small; the host supplies execution opportunities and abstract packets, while Stage owns the selected worldline, temporal orchestration, interaction, and rendering composition.
Accept: Stage owns its Orchestrator transitively, the host does not select logical time or branch semantics, explicit Tau sampling remains available for replay/tests, and rendering receives only the selected GameState and Tau.
